DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at
	 no extra cost to you. \nGet Tickets \nAbout the Show\nParental Advisory: 
	Comedy and Wine is a hilarious blend of live stand-up comedy and global wi
	ne tasting\, presented by Lou Perez and Deborah Sklar at Some Good Wine in
	 New York City. Five talented comedians perform live sets while expert win
	e pours and explanations take place between acts — a seamless evening of l
	aughs and libations. \nThis is the ultimate way to discover new favorite w
	ines while enjoying the vibrant NYC comedy scene. Get a babysitter and tre
	at yourself to a night out unlike any other. \nEvent Details\nDate: July 3
	0\, 2026 (additional date: August 27\, 2026)\nTime: 7:00 PM\nVenue: Some G
	ood Wine\nAddress: 13 E 8th Street\, New York\, NY 10003\nCity: New York\,
	 NY\nPrice: $30.00 General Admission\nNote: Exclusive 10% discount on feat
	ured wine and spirits available \nAbout the Venue\nSome Good Wine is a bou
	tique wine shop and event space located at 13 E 8th Street in Greenwich Vi
	llage\, New York City. Known for its curated selection of global wines and
	 intimate atmosphere\, it’s the perfect setting for an evening that combin
	es comedy and wine culture in equal measure. \nWhat to Expect\nEnjoy five 
	stand-up comedy sets from some of New York City’s hottest comics\, with ex
	pert wine pours and explanations woven seamlessly between each performance
	. The format ensures a relaxed\, entertaining pace — you’ll laugh\, learn 
	about wine\, and discover new favorites all in one evening. \nAn exclusive
	 10% discount on featured wine and spirits is available for attendees\, ma
	king this a great opportunity to take home a bottle from the show. \nTicke
	t Information\nTickets are available through Fever. General Admission is $
	30.00. No booking fees. Select your preferred date (July 30 or August 27\,
	 2026) during purchase. \nGet Tickets\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/
	parental-advisory-comedy-and-wine-live-at-some-good-wine/\n\nFrom Comedy C
	alendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/parental-advisory-comedy-and-wine-live
	-at-some-good-wine/
LOCATION:Some Good Wine\, 13 E 8th St\, New York\, NY\, 10003\, United Stat
	es
