SUMMARY:Nate Bargatze: Big Dumb Eyes World Tour LIVE at PPG Paints Arena (J
	uly 30)
DTSTAMP:20260730T055256Z
DTSTART:20260730T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate l
	inks. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Perfor
	mer\nNate Bargatze is one of America’s most beloved stand-up comedians\, k
	nown for his clean\, relatable humor and masterful storytelling. Hailing f
	rom Old Hickory\, Tennessee\, Nate grew up in a household steeped in comed
	y — his father is a former clown turned magician\, which gave Nate a uniqu
	e perspective on performance from an early age. \nWith a style that blends
	 self-deprecating wit\, Southern charm\, and perfectly timed observations 
	about everyday life\, Nate has become a household name. He has appeared on
	 The Tonight Show Starring Jimmy Fallon multiple times\, released multiple
	 Netflix specials including The Tennessee Kid\, The Greatest Average Ameri
	can\, and Hello World\, and sold out arenas across the country. \nHis Big 
	Dumb Eyes World Tour is his most ambitious tour yet — a massive arena run 
	that showcases why Nate Bargatze is considered one of the top stand-up com
	edians working today. Fans can expect his signature blend of slow-burn sto
	rytelling\, hilarious family anecdotes\, and the kind of comedy that makes
	 you laugh until your sides hurt. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Thursday\, July
	 30\, 2026\nShow Time: 7:00 PM (Doors open approximately 6:00 PM)\nVenue: 
	PPG Paints Arena\, 1001 Fifth Avenue\, Pittsburgh\, PA 15219\nPhone: (412)
	 642-1800\nAge Restrictions: All ages welcome\; content is clean and famil
	y-friendly\nShow Duration: Approximately 90 minutes\n\nAbout the Venue\nPP
	G Paints Arena is Pittsburgh’s premier indoor entertainment venue\, locate
	d in the heart of downtown Pittsburgh at 1001 Fifth Avenue. With a seating
	 capacity of approximately 18\,387\, it is one of the largest arenas in Pe
	nnsylvania and serves as the home of the Pittsburgh Penguins NHL team. \nT
	he arena features state-of-the-art sound and lighting systems\, multiple c
	oncession levels\, premium club seating\, and luxury suites. The venue is 
	known for its excellent sightlines from virtually every seat in the house\
	, making it an ideal setting for large-scale comedy performances. The Lowe
	r Level offers an intimate arena experience\, while the Upper Level provid
	es sweeping views of the entire stage. \nPPG Paints Arena is easily access
	ible via public transit\, with multiple bus routes and the Light Rail (T) 
	stopping nearby at Steel Plaza and Gateway stations. Parking is available 
	in several nearby garages including the Arena Parking Garage directly adja
	cent to the venue. The arena is fully ADA accessible with dedicated seatin
	g areas and accessible entrances throughout. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is a s
	olo stand-up comedy performance by Nate Bargatze as part of his Big Dumb E
	yes World Tour. The show will feature Nate performing his brand-new materi
	al in a full arena setting\, complete with professional production\, light
	ing\, and sound. \nNate’s shows are known for being incredibly welcoming t
	o all audiences — his clean comedy style means this is a perfect night out
	 for couples\, families\, and groups of friends alike. Expect an evening f
	illed with laugh-out-loud moments\, heartwarming stories\, and the kind of
	 comedy that stays with you long after the show ends. \nArrive early to fi
	nd your seats and grab concessions before the show begins. The arena fills
	 up quickly for Nate Bargatze performances\, so plan to arrive at least 30
	-45 minutes before showtime. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $100 – $73
	2+ (resale prices vary) \nOfficial tickets are available through Ticketmas
	ter. Resale tickets are available through VividSeats with all-in pricing a
	nd a 100% Buyer Guarantee. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post co
	ntains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\
	n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/nate-bargatze-big-dumb-eyes-world-tour
	-live-at-ppg-paints-arena-july/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/nate-bargatze-big-dumb-eyes-world-tour
	-live-at-ppg-paints-arena-july/
LOCATION:PPG Paints Arena\, 1001 Fifth Avenue\, Pittsburgh\, Pennsylvania\,
	 15219\, United States
