SUMMARY:Corey Holcomb LIVE at Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club
DTSTAMP:20260730T055256Z
DTSTART:20260731T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nCorey Hol
	comb is a stand-up comedy genius whose comedy transcends class and racial 
	divides\, known for his hilarious and brutally honest takes on relationshi
	ps\, gender dynamics\, and everyday life. \nHe hit his first open mic in 1
	992 and has been a full-time comedian ever since\, taking top honors at th
	e Miller Genuine Draft Comedy Search\, Budweiser Comedy Competition\, and 
	Laffapalooza. He has appeared at the Montreal Just for Laughs Festival and
	 the Chicago Comedy Festival. \nCorey’s television and film credits includ
	e NBC’s The Tonight Show\, MTV2’s Wild ‘N Out\, NBC’s Last Comic Standing\
	, HBO’s Def Comedy Jam\, Tyler Perry’s House of Pain\, Fox’s The Cleveland
	 Show\, and three of his own comedy specials on Comedy Central and Showtim
	e. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Friday\, July 31\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM (Doors 
	open at 6:00 PM)\nVenue: Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club\, 618 NW Loop 410\, Sa
	n Antonio\, TX 78216\nAge Restriction: 18+ Event\nAdditional Shows: Also p
	erforming July 31 (9:30 PM)\, August 1 (7:00 PM & 9:30 PM)\nFood & Beverag
	e: 2-item minimum per person once seated\n\nAbout the Venue\nLaugh Out Lou
	d Comedy Club (LOL San Antonio) is San Antonio’s premier stand-up comedy d
	estination\, conveniently located in Park North Plaza at Loop 410 and Blan
	co\, just inside the loop and a few miles from the airport. \nThe intimate
	 club setting creates an electric atmosphere where every seat feels close 
	to the stage\, making for an incredibly personal and engaging comedy exper
	ience. \nThe venue features a full bar and dining service\, so guests can 
	enjoy food and drinks throughout the show. Seating is first come\, first s
	erved by section\, so arriving early is recommended to secure the best sea
	ts. \nLOL San Antonio is part of the nationally recognized Improv comedy c
	lub network\, consistently bringing top-tier national touring comedians to
	 San Antonio. \nWhat to Expect\nCorey Holcomb delivers a full headlining s
	tand-up set that is both an auditory and visual experience — his facial ge
	stures alone can make an audience burst with laughter. \nExpect sharp\, un
	filtered relationship comedy that offers plenty of advice\, observations\,
	 and remedies delivered with Corey’s signature candid style. His comedy is
	 relatable to people all over the world who understand the drama of making
	 relationships work. \nThis is an 18+ event with adult-oriented\, unfilter
	ed material. Arrive early to grab a great seat and enjoy the full club exp
	erience with food and drinks before the show. \nTicket Information\nPrice 
	Range: $40 – $62 (plus fees) \nTickets are available through official and 
	resale channels: \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains aff
	iliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps:/
	/comedycalendar.com/event/corey-holcomb-live-at-laugh-out-loud-comedy-club
	/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
