SUMMARY:Steve-O: Crash & Burn LIVE at Cobb's Comedy Club
DTSTAMP:20260730T055256Z
DTSTART:20260731T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \n\nOfficial 
	Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nSteve-O: Crash & Burn LIVE at Cobb’s Comedy Clu
	b\nThe legendary Steve-O is bringing his outrageous  stand-up tour to Cobb
	’s Comedy Club in San Francisco for a night of wild\, unfiltered comedy. B
	est known as a founding member of the Jackass franchise\, Steve-O has rein
	vented himself as a stand-up comedian\, delivering brutally honest and hil
	arious stories from his extraordinary life. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\
	, July 31\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM PDT (Doors open at 6:00 PM)\nVenue: Cobb’s
	 Comedy Club\nAddress: 915 Columbus Avenue\, San Francisco\, CA 94133\nAge
	 Requirement: 18+ (Valid photo ID required)\nBeverage Minimum: Two-drink m
	inimum per person \nAbout Steve-O\nSteve-O (Stephen Gilchrist Glover) is a
	 comedian\, stunt performer\, and television personality best known for hi
	s work on MTV’s Jackass franchise. After years of wild stunts and personal
	 struggles\, Steve-O has emerged as a compelling stand-up comedian\, shari
	ng his incredible life story with raw honesty and humor. His  tour showcas
	es his evolution from daredevil to storyteller\, delivering laughs that on
	ly someone who has truly lived on the edge can provide. \nWhat to Expect\n
	\nA full evening of stand-up comedy featuring Steve-O’s signature outrageo
	us humor\nWild\, unfiltered stories from his life as a Jackass star and be
	yond\nAn intimate club setting at the legendary Cobb’s Comedy Club\nDoors 
	open one hour before showtime — arrive early for the best seats\nFull bar 
	service with a two-drink minimum per person\nAn unforgettable Friday night
	 out in San Francisco’s North Beach neighborhood\n\nVenue Information\nCob
	b’s Comedy Club is one of San Francisco’s premier comedy venues\, located 
