	ommentary\, Burr has released multiple acclaimed Netflix specials and star
	s in the hit series “F Is for Family.” His Monday Morning Podcast is one o
	f the most downloaded comedy podcasts in the world. \nWhat to Expect\n\nFe
	arless\, no-holds-barred stand-up comedy from one of the best in the busin
	ess\nSharp observations on modern life\, relationships\, and pop culture\n
	A phone-free experience — be fully present for every punchline\nHigh-energ
