	\n\nVenue Information\nThe Reno Events Center is a premier entertainment v
	enue located in the heart of downtown Reno at 400 University Way. The faci
	lity offers excellent sightlines\, accessible seating\, and is convenientl
	y located near major casinos and hotels. The venue enforces a clear bag po
	licy — visit the RSCVA website for details. \nTicket Information\nTickets 
