SUMMARY:Thank Comedy Its Friday Late Night Stand Up Show LIVE at The Comic 
	Strip
DTSTAMP:20260730T055256Z
DTSTART:20260731T220000Z
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at
	 no extra cost to you. \nGet Tickets \nAbout the Show\nKick off the weeken
	d the right way at the iconic Comic Strip Live with “Thank Comedy It’s Fri
	day” — New York City’s premier late-night stand-up comedy show. Featuring 
	hilarious sets from top comedians seen on Netflix\, HBO\, Comedy Central\,
	 BET\, and viral social media platforms\, this is the perfect way to shake
	 off the week. \nDJ E.M. provides a live show soundtrack to keep the energ
	y high all night long. Bring your friends\, grab a drink\, and enjoy an ev
	ening packed with jokes\, good vibes\, and great company. \nEvent Details\
	nDate: July 31\, 2026Time: Doors open at 10:00 PM\; Showtime starts at 10:
	30 PMVenue: The Comic Strip (Comic Strip Live)Address: 1568 2nd Avenue\, N
	ew York\, NY 10028City: New York\, NYPrice: $25.00 General AdmissionAge Re
	striction: 21+ with valid IDNote: Two-item minimum purchase per person req
	uired \nAbout the Venue\nThe Comic Strip is one of New York City’s most ic
	onic comedy clubs\, located at 1568 2nd Avenue on the Upper East Side. A l
	egendary launching pad for countless comedy careers\, this intimate venue 
	has hosted some of the biggest names in stand-up. Accessible via the 77th 
	St (6 train) and 86th St (Q train) subway stations. \nWhat to Expect\nExpe
	ct a high-energy late-night comedy experience with a rotating lineup of to
	p-tier talent from Netflix and Comedy Central. The live DJ soundtrack keep
	s the atmosphere electric from the moment you walk in until the last punch
	line lands. \nThis is the ultimate Friday night out in NYC — laughs\, drin
	ks\, and great vibes at one of the city’s most storied comedy venues. \nTi
	cket Information\nTickets are available through Fever. General Admission i
	s $25.00. Must be 21+ with valid ID. A two-item minimum purchase per perso
	n is required at the event. \nGet Tickets\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/ev
	ent/thank-comedy-its-friday-late-night-stand-up-show-live-at-the-comic-str
	ip-jul-d/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/thank-comedy-its-friday-late-night-sta
	nd-up-show-live-at-the-comic-strip-jul-d/
LOCATION:The Comic Strip\, 1568 2nd Avenue\, New York\, NY 10028\, New York
	\, NY\, 10028\, United States
